# Force LF line endings in the repository and in every checkout, whatever the
# platform or core.autocrlf setting (matches end_of_line in .editorconfig). Needed by Prettier on
# the Windows CI runner and by release-please's TOML parser.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
